## 2. Game List & Collection Mapping

7 games, mỗi game 4 collections report:

| Game       | Entity package   | Application package          | Worker app       | Prefix    |
|------------|------------------|------------------------------|------------------|-----------|
| Lotto 5/35 | game-lotto535    | game-lotto535-application    | worker-lotto535  | lotto535  |
| Mega 6/45  | game-mega645     | game-mega645-application     | worker-mega645   | mega645   |
| Power 6/55 | game-power655    | game-power655-application    | worker-power655  | power655  |
| Keno       | game-keno        | game-keno-application        | worker-keno      | keno      |
| Bingo 18   | game-bingo18     | game-bingo18-application     | worker-bingo18   | bingo18   |
| Max 3D     | game-max3d       | game-max3d-application       | worker-max3d     | max3d     |
| Max 3D Pro | game-max3dpro    | game-max3dpro-application    | worker-max3dpro  | max3dpro  |

### Per-game collections (4 x 7 = 28):

```
{prefix}_settle_draw_reports        -- 1 doc/draw đã settle
{prefix}_settle_tenant_reports      -- 1 doc/tenant/draw đã settle
{prefix}_void_draw_reports          -- 1 doc/draw đã void
{prefix}_outstanding_draw_reports   -- 1 doc/draw active (TTL 15 min)
```

### System collections (3):

```
system_settle_game_daily            -- 1 doc/game/financialDate (aggregate by financialDate cho daily total)
system_settle_tenant_daily          -- 1 doc/tenant/game/financialDate (aggregate by {financialDate,tenantId} cho tenant total)
system_outstanding_game_daily       -- 1 doc/game (TTL 15 min)
```

**LƯU Ý**: Không có `system_settle_daily` riêng. Daily total = aggregate `system_settle_game_daily` by financialDate.

