## 6. Crash-Safety — Phân tích từng điểm crash

### Settle Report crash:
- Crash sau tenant upsert (partial): Retry upsert overwrite -> idempotent, không duplicate.
- Crash sau draw upsert: Draw report OK, daily stale. Retry Phase 2 re-aggregate -> correct.
- Crash sau game_daily: Continue Phase 2. tenant_daily + daily re-aggregate.

### Void Report crash:
- Crash sau snapshot (0a): Void report created, settle vẫn còn. Retry: upsert void (idempotent), rồi delete settle.
- Crash sau delete tenant (0b): Tenant deleted, draw report còn. Retry: delete draw (idempotent), re-aggregate.
- Crash sau delete draw (0c): Settle đã xoá, daily stale. Retry: Phase 2 re-aggregate -> correct.

### Outstanding crash:
- Crash ở bất kỳ đâu: Stale docs tự expire qua TTL. Job run tiếp theo tạo lại.

