## 7. Code Locations — BẮT BUỘC đặt file đúng chỗ

### Entity Layer
```
packages/game-{game}/src/entities/report.ts
  -> SettleDrawReport, SettleTenantReport, VoidDrawReport, OutstandingDrawReport
  -> Collection constants
  -> Export qua entities/index.ts

packages/game-core/src/entities/financial-report.ts
  -> SystemSettleGameDaily, SystemSettleTenantDaily
  -> SystemOutstandingGameDaily
  -> Collection constants
  -> Export qua entities/index.ts
```

### Repository Layer
```
packages/game-{game}-application/src/infras/repos/
  settle-draw-report-repo.ts
    -> upsertDrawReport(report: SettleDrawReport)
    -> deleteByDrawId(drawId: string)
    -> findByDrawId(drawId: string): SettleDrawReport | null

  settle-tenant-report-repo.ts
    -> upsertTenantReports(reports: SettleTenantReport[])
    -> deleteByDrawId(drawId: string)

  void-report-repo.ts
    -> upsertVoidReport(report: VoidDrawReport)

  outstanding-report-repo.ts
    -> upsertDrawReport(report: OutstandingDrawReport)
    -> aggregateForGame(): summary for system

packages/game-core-application/src/infras/repos/
  system-settle-report-repo.ts
    -> upsertGameDaily(report: SystemSettleGameDaily)
    -> upsertTenantDaily(report: SystemSettleTenantDaily)
    -> aggregateDrawsFromPerGameCollection(collName, financialDate)
    -> aggregateTenantsFromPerGameCollection(collName, financialDate)

  system-outstanding-report-repo.ts
    -> upsertGameOutstanding(report: SystemOutstandingGameDaily)
    -> aggregateFromPerGameCollection(collName)
```

**LƯU Ý QUAN TRỌNG**:
- Settle draw report và settle tenant report PHẢI tách riêng repo (không mix).
- Aggregation queries cho system reports PHẢI nằm trong repo layer, KHÔNG inline trong use case.
- Use case chỉ orchestrate flow — gọi repo aggregate rồi gọi repo upsert.

### Use Case Layer
```
packages/game-{game}-application/src/use-cases/settle/
  build-settle-report.ts    <- Phase 1: entries -> per-game reports

packages/game-{game}-application/src/use-cases/void/
  build-void-report.ts      <- Phase 0+1: cleanup + void report

packages/game-core-application/src/use-cases/
  publish-settle-daily.ts   <- Phase 2: re-aggregate system (dùng chung settle + void)
  sync-outstanding.ts       <- Outstanding sync per-game
  sync-system-outstanding.ts <- Outstanding sync system
```

### Worker Layer
```
apps/worker-{game}/src/
  handlers/settle/build-settle-report.ts   <- Lambda handler
  handlers/settle/publish-settle-daily.ts  <- Lambda handler (reuse PublishSettleDailyUseCase)
  handlers/void/build-void-report.ts       <- Lambda handler
  handlers/void/publish-settle-daily.ts    <- Lambda handler (reuse PublishSettleDailyUseCase)
  handlers/outstanding/sync-outstanding.ts <- Scheduled lambda

  step-functions/
    settle.ts        <- Thêm BuildSettleReport + PublishSettleDaily TRƯỚC FinalizeSettle
    void.ts          <- Thêm BuildVoidReport + PublishSettleDaily TRƯỚC FinalizeVoid
```

**LƯU Ý**: KHÔNG cần tạo/regenerate file `.asl.json` trong quá trình code.
Chỉ sửa file `.ts` — file `.asl.json` sẽ được tạo thủ công sau.

