## 8. Player-Level: On-Demand Query (KHÔNG pre-compute)

Player drill-down (xem từng player trong 1 draw/tenant) KHÔNG tạo report riêng.
Query trực tiếp từ `{prefix}_ticket_entries`:

```typescript
db.collection.aggregate([
  { $match: { drawId, tenantId, status: "settled" } },
  { $group: {
    _id: "$accountId",
    username: { $first: "$username" },
    entryCount: { $sum: 1 },
    totalStake: { $sum: "$amount" },
    totalWin: { $sum: { $ifNull: ["$payout.winAmount", 0] } },
    totalPayout: { $sum: { $ifNull: ["$payout.payoutAmount", 0] } },
  }},
  { $sort: { totalStake: -1 } },
]);
```

Index cần: `{ drawId: 1, tenantId: 1, accountId: 1 }`.

