## 9. Repo Write Pattern — BẮT BUỘC

Tất cả repo write PHẢI dùng upsert pattern:

```typescript
async upsertDrawReport(report: SettleDrawReport): Promise<void> {
  const now = new Date();
  await this.findOneAndUpdate(
    {
      drawId: report.drawId,
    },
    {
      $set: {
        ...report,
        updatedAt: now,
      },
      $setOnInsert: {
        createdAt: now,
      },
    },
    {
      upsert: true,
    },
  );
}
```

Delete PHẢI dùng deleteMany (idempotent — xoá 0 docs cũng OK):

```typescript
async deleteByDrawId(drawId: string): Promise<void> {
  await this.deleteMany({
    drawId,
  });
}
```

